    Di hDi R k hk hz T iT g hP DT hDT hepi
  obtain ⟨ratR, htors, hcomm⟩ := hrat R k hk hz T iT g hP Dk hDk DT hDT hepi γ hγ DΛ hDΛ γΛ hγΛ
